meta {
  name: Run AI Startup Analysis
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/startup-analysis
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "startupName": "BharatMed HealthTech",
    "industry": "HealthTech",
    "monthlyRevenueINR": 450000,
    "monthlyBurnINR": 320000,
    "runwayMonths": 14,
    "targetMarket": "Tier-2 and Tier-3 hospitals across Tamil Nadu and South India"
  }
}

docs {
  # Run AI Startup Analysis
  Run comprehensive AI strategic assessment evaluating runway, TAM, threats, and Indian market product-market fit.

  ### Authentication
  Bearer Token

  ### Allowed Roles
  - Founder
- Mentor
- Admin

  ### Response Status Codes
  - `200` - Detailed AI diagnosis, SWOT, and recommendations returned.
  - `500` - AI generation error.

  ### Response Example (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "analysis": {
      "id": "ana_101",
      "healthScore": 84,
      "strengths": [
        "Positive gross margin",
        "High defensibility in Tier-2 Indian cities"
      ],
      "runwayAssessment": "14 months runway in INR provides adequate buffer for Seed extension.",
      "actionItems": [
        "File patent with Indian Patent Office",
        "Onboard 15 additional clinics"
      ]
    }
  }
  ```
}
